  "details": "Adding a curve to a PhysBone with Multi Child Type of First will error and break the property in Unity. It does not occur in VRChat, I assume because it is the curve element in the Inspector that is causing errors.\n\nI don't know why anyone would attempt to use a curve on a physbone with no child/endpoint, but it is an error so I reported it.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/k2J6bbNso7w\n\n**Assertion failed on expression: 'curveT >= GetRange().first && curveT <= GetRange().second'**\n**Assertion failed on expression: 'curveT >= m_Curve[lhs].time && curveT <= m_Curve[rhs].time'**\n\nnakos",
